      "platform_excerpts": [
        {
          "issue_slug": "foreign_policy",
          "excerpt": "In November 2023, Moskowitz was one of 12 House Democrats to vote for a $14.3 billion aid package to Israel...He wrote on October 10 supporting strong retaliation by Israel after the October 7 attacks, 'This is the largest attack in Israel in 50 years, The response will be the largest response in 50 years.'",
