        },
        {
          "issue_slug": "economy",
          "excerpt": "Moskowitz was the only Democrat to join the Department of Government Efficiency (DOGE) caucus in Congress. He proposed reorganizing the Department of Homeland Security (DHS) by potentially removing agencies such as the Federal Emergency Management Agency (FEMA) and the Secret Service from its jurisdiction. This proposal aims to reduce the size of the DHS.",
          "source": "wikipedia",
          "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jared_Moskowitz"
